  "ingredients": [
    "1 pound ground beef",
    "0.75 cup bread crumbs",
    "1 large egg, beaten",
    "2 tablespoons grated Parmesan cheese",
    "2 tablespoons chopped fresh parsley",
    "2 cloves garlic, minced",
    "2 teaspoons dried Italian seasoning",
    "1 French baguette",
    "1 tablespoon extra-virgin olive oil",
    "0.5 teaspoon garlic powder",
    "1 pinch salt, or to taste",
    "1 (14 ounce) jar spaghetti sauce",
    "4 slices provolone cheese"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine ground beef, bread crumbs, egg, Parmesan cheese, parsley, garlic, and Italian seasoning in a large bowl; mix with your hands until well combined. Shape mixture into 12 meatballs; place in a baking dish.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Q5rYx1qbxsAcK-7XMH3GzXkj0PQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/90321-MeatballSandwitch-mfs-Step1-3137-2b4446025e834824980b65cd3d2d55a8.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/90321/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until meatballs cooked through, 15 to 20 minutes. An instant-read thermometer inserted into centers should read at least 160 degrees F (71 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, cut baguette in half lengthwise; open like a book. Remove and discard some of the bread from the inside to make a well for the meatballs.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Brush baguette with olive oil; season with garlic powder and salt. Place baguette on a baking sheet, opened, oiled-sides up.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/G6WJMUjVW1TgGGgePqjIo2Ba-aM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/90321-MeatballSandwitch-mfs-Step2-3143-30430429a51245c187491e5611595bb9.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/90321/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "When meatballs have 5 minutes cooking time left, place baguette in the oven until lightly toasted.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, warm spaghetti sauce in a saucepan over medium heat.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove meatballs from the oven. Transfer meatballs to the sauce using a slotted spoon; stir gently to coat with sauce.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/NNfEpiN3TkPelMQS2h0lO-kMbBA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/90321-MeatballSandwitch-mfs-Step3-3148-4cf0bd0fc455475dac90e54435350af2.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/90321/step_08.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spoon meatballs and sauce into one side of baguette, nestling meatballs in the well; top with provolone cheese.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ehdQASjBHZBzCxOiOt-NrIt1pg8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/90321-MeatballSandwitch-mfs-Step4-3158-e1f3fd0d897f49ada7f26cba970998a5.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/90321/step_09.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the oven until cheese is melted, 2 to 3 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Sh0cFgtHrk90A6CL2n3s_LacGj4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/90321-MeatballSandwitch-mfs-Step5-3161-5edbc0fb44b247e0b1f0ad2a4e72c3be.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/90321/step_10.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cool slightly, then cut into 4 sandwiches.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/sIM2URzrzfnBw05YIMJ_OIX0I9g=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/90321-MeatballSandwitch-mfs-4X3-3198-440166ae852a489db357ee576b71ccd4.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/90321/step_11.webp"
    }
  ],
